      "options": {
        "content": "## ClawQL Enterprise — Org spend\n\nGauges from `clawql payments org spend --prometheus` / `renderAllOrgCreditsPrometheus` ([docs/enterprise/control-plane.md](https://github.com/danielsmithdevelopment/ClawQL/blob/main/docs/enterprise/control-plane.md)). Scrape the exporter that publishes `clawql_org_*` series (CLI scrape sidecar or MCP metrics extension).",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "About",
      "transparent": true,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
